        "role": "user",
        "content": "PUBLIC TASK (verbatim):\nNorthwind Components needs the allocation desk decision file for order wave TRAIN_TRANSFER_B.\n\nUse the shared ERP API described in the task group environment README. Use the API base URL supplied by the runner as `<TASK_ENV_BASE_URL>`. Inspect the live ERP records for the wave, customers, products, warehouses, and inventory as needed. A short desk memo is available in input/payloads/allocation_memo.md.\n\nReturn a single JSON object matching input/payloads/answer_template.json. The decision file should classify every order line in TRAIN_TRANSFER_B as one of the allowed actions, include transfer requests where internal movement can clear the shortage, identify account-blocked orders, and summarize the wave.\n\n\nPUBLIC INPUT FILES (relative to input/; byte sizes):\n{\"payloads/allocation_memo.md\":975,\"payloads/answer_template.json\":3342,\"prompt.txt\":714}\n\nOFFICIAL BUSINESS GET DOCUMENTATION:\n## Domain Endpoints\n\n- `GET /health`\n- `GET /products`\n- `GET /products/<sku>`\n- `GET /customers`\n- `GET /customers/<customer_id>`\n- `GET /warehouses`\n- `GET /inventory?warehouse_id=&sku=`\n- `GET /purchase_orders?supplier_id=&sku=&status=`\n- `GET /orders?wave=&required_date=&customer_id=`\n- `GET /orders/<order_id>`\n- `GET /shipping/quote?warehouse_id=&destination_zip=&weight_lb=&speed=`\n- `GET /incidents?start=&end=&supplier_id=&sku=&incident_type=&status=`\n- `GET /suppliers`\n- `GET /boms`\n- `GET /boms/<bom_id>`\n\n\nSELECTED PROJECT GUIDANCE:\n\n\nSELECTED ASSET CATALOG (read only when needed):\n[]\n\nEXECUTION LIMITS:\n{\"max_completion_tokens\":8192,\"max_input_chars\":100000,\"max_model_calls\":6,\"max_tool_calls\":128,\"max_tool_output_chars\":20000}"
      },
